---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
const updated = 'Draft, not yet in effect';
---
<Base title="Disclosures" description="How the lab uses AI, how it handles money and conflicts, and what its work is and isn't." showDispatchSignup={false}>
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Disclosures</h1>
    <p class="pending">[DRAFT: needs founder review before launch]</p>
    <p class="meta">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <h2>How the work gets made</h2>
    <p>A person decides what to make. AI agents help research, build and draft it. A person checks the work before anything is published. We say this up front because it's how the lab works, not a footnote.</p>

    <h2>Sources</h2>
    <p>Every number and factual claim we publish links to where it came from. If we can't source it, we don't publish it.</p>

    <h2>Not advice</h2>
    <p>Nothing here is financial, investment, legal or tax advice. We explain where money moves and why; what you do with that is up to you. We don't make stock picks.</p>

    <h2>Money and conflicts</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Sponsors and ads:</strong> none right now. If that changes, sponsored content will be labeled where it appears, and sponsors won't get a say in what we report.</li>
      <li><strong>Affiliate links:</strong> none right now. If we ever use them, they'll be labeled.</li>
      <li><strong>Investments:</strong> <span class="pending">[How the lab's owner discloses holdings in companies we cover is still being decided. This line gets the final rule before launch.]</span></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Corrections</h2>
    <p>When we get something wrong, we fix it, note what changed and when, and keep the note where readers will see it.</p>

    <h2>Who's behind it</h2>
    <p>Uncle Buck's Laboratory is run by its owner, who goes by Uncle Buck online. It's an independent project, not connected to the owner's day job or any employer.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
